# U.S.S. Defiant, Mirror Migrant for {2} cast with flash during Bot2's turn, so it is not on the battlefield in time to be
# cast for free: its enters ability phases out the Spacecraft and the one creature of Bot1's own that it targets, together
# (CR 702.26b, 702.26h), while Bot2's Memnite is refused as a target ("you control", CR 109.5) and Bot1's own Ornithopter is
# left phased in. Both phase in during Bot1's next untap step (CR 502.1), so they are on the battlefield again on turn 3.

